    {
      "id": "harmony-03-010",
      "skill": "harmony",
      "module": "03",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "stem": "关于 V1 的 @Prop，下列哪项描述正确？",
      "explanation": "@Prop 用于父到子的单向同步，子组件可以有本地修改，但不会把修改反向写回父组件源值；需要双向同步时才考虑 @Link。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "title": "状态管理概述",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-state-management-overview"
        },
        {
          "title": "@State：组件内状态",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-references/ts-state-management-state"
        }
      ],
      "type": "single",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "text": "父组件源值可同步到子组件，子组件本地修改不反向写回源值"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "子组件每次修改都会自动双向写回父组件"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "父组件必须通过 this.$value 才能初始化任意 @Prop"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "@Prop 与 @Link 的同步方向和规则完全相同"
        }
      ],
      "answer": [
        "A"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "harmony-03-011",
      "skill": "harmony",
      "module": "03",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "stem": "关于跨组件状态共享与 V2 父子通信，下列哪些说法正确？",
      "explanation": "V1 可用 @Provide/@Consume 跨层级共享，V2 可用 @Param 传数据、@Event 通知父组件；AppStorage 是内存状态中枢，不会自动把全部状态持久化到磁盘。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "title": "状态管理概述",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-state-management-overview"
        },
        {
          "title": "@Provide 与 @Consume",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-provide-and-consume"
        }
      ],
      "type": "multi",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "text": "V1 可用 @Provide/@Consume 在祖先与后代间共享状态"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "V2 可用 @Param 向下传数据、@Event 向上通知变更意图"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "AppStorage 会把其中任意状态自动写入磁盘并永久保存"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "同一条数据流应随意交替使用 @State 与 @Local 以避免刷新"
        }
      ],
      "answer": [
        "A",
        "B"
      ]
    },
